   "script": "Route111_EventScript_1503BE",
   "texts": {
    "Route111_Text_1BAC60": "I'm having a picnic in the desert.\\pYou can always find a TRAINER, so\\nI can enjoy a battle here, too!$",
    "Route111_Text_1BACC5": "Ohhh! You're mean!$",
    "Route111_Text_1BACD8": "When you're battling in a sandstorm,\\nwatch out for your POKéMON's HP.\\pIt can faint if you don't keep an eye\\non it!$"
