    "Route111_Text_1BB313": "I see, you've toughened them\\nconsiderably.$",
    "Route111_Text_1BB33E": "POKéMON and TRAINERS learn much\\nthrough battling.\\pWhat's important is to never give up\\neven if you lose.$"
